on how to crush law school.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:49.530
So do you feel the need to
become a lawyer in your bones?

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.360
Is law school worth it for you?

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.780
Let me know in the comments below.

